# Pilot week hourly ops report (example cron)

Run during the first live pilot week:

```bash
# Every hour during business hours (adjust TZ for NYC office)
0 9-18 * * 1-5 cd /path/to/somo/middleware-platform && npm run report:front-desk-ops >> /var/log/somo-pilot-ops.log 2>&1
```

Manual one-shot:

```bash
cd middleware-platform
npm run report:front-desk-ops
```

See also: `docs/voice-agent/PILOT_ONCALL_WEEK.md`
